    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "can you explain a bit more about that neural part? when you say the body 'prioritizes shorter movements' or that the nervous system is reacting to the fatigue, how does that actually manifest during a heavy set? it just seems like a really sudden wall to hit.",
      "source": "evaluator"
